     all Copyright and Similar Rights that apply to Your use of the
     Licensed Material and that the Licensor has authority to license.

  j. Licensor means the individual(s) or entity(ies) granting rights
     under this Public License.

  k. Share means to provide the Licensed Material to the public by any
     means or process that requires permission under the Licensed
     Rights, such as reproduction, public display, public performance,
     distribution, dissemination, communication, or importation, and to
     make the Licensed Material available to the public including in
     ways that members of the public may access the material from a
