  b. if You include all or a substantial portion of the database
     contents in a database in which You own Sui Generis Database
     Rights, then the database in which You hold Sui Generis Database
     Rights (but not its individual contents) is Adapted Material,
     including for purposes of Section 3(b); and

  c. You must comply with the conditions in Section 3(a) if You Share
     all or a substantial portion of the database contents.

  For the avoidance of doubt, this Section 4 supplements and does not
  replace Your obligations under this Public License where the
  Licensed Rights include other Copyright and Similar Rights.

